  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You can perform a ritual to place yourself into a restful sleep. When you finish, you fall prone and sleep for 1 hour. The effect ends early if you are harmed. If you sleep the whole time, you heal @[4d6|h] damage and you make Intellect and Will rolls with 1 boon for 24 hours. Once you use this talent, you lose access to it until after you rest.</p>",
